QyhaSnwy7qxtIl?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kuronekozonbi/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7496d63/uploads/origins/3fb501aa-510b-47e0-8ba7-4083a1246090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=279d5374be35eabfadef711cd25d52aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7496d63/uploads/origins/3fb501aa-510b-47e0-8ba7-4083a1246090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=279d5374be35eabfadef711cd25d52aa, https://si.imgix.net/f7496d63/uploads/origins/3fb501aa-510b-47e0-8ba7-4083a1246090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=941b6b25038a812ea2c546bd33cec9a1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7496d63/uploads/origins/3fb501aa-510b-47e0-8ba7-4083a1246090?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=179218159322c39331bd972fcca53d6f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hi!\nI would like to request a nsfw picture of the character \"Kuro-A\" (黒-A) from the game \"Dekapari\" (でかぱり).\nKuro-A (黒-A) should be giving a handjob while looking slighty annoyed.\nShe should be nude. Her breasts should be small.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/pXhxag9\n\nThank you for your time!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kuronekozonbi/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2347ca2e/uploads/origins/f255dec9-b85e-4afa-9efc-5b4ae8567e77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f17d229e7b836f28836dc9c840ccbe7c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2347ca2e/uploads/origins/f255dec9-b85e-4afa-9efc-5b4ae8567e77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f17d229e7b836f28836dc9c840ccbe7c, https://si.imgix.net/2347ca2e/uploads/origins/f255dec9-b85